    "answer": {
      "short": "$x=\\dfrac{-3\\pm\\sqrt5}{2}$",
      "worked": "Using $a=1$, $b=3$ and $c=1$ in the quadratic formula:\n$$\\begin{align*}x&=\\frac{-3\\pm\\sqrt{3^2-4(1)(1)}}{2(1)}\\\\x&=\\frac{-3\\pm\\sqrt5}{2}.\\end{align*}$$",
